"sd":null},{"k":"89:4","t":"And [by] the night when it passes,","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"89:5","t":"Is there [not] in [all] that an oath [sufficient] for one of perception?","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"89:6","t":"Have you not considered how your Lord dealt with ʿAad -","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"89:7","t":"[With] Iram - who had lofty pillars,","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"89:8","t":"The likes of whom had never been created in the land?","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"89:9","t":"And [with] Thamūd, who carved out the rocks in the valley?","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"89:10","t":"And [with] Pharaoh, owner of the stakes?","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"89:11","t":"[All of] whom oppressed within the lands","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"89:12","t":"And increased therein the corruption.","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"89:13","t":"So your Lord poured upon them a scourge of punishment.","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"89:14","t":"Indeed, your Lord is in observation.","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"89:15","t":"And as for man, when his Lord tries him and [thus] is generous to him and favors him, he says, \"My Lord has honored me.\"","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"89:16","t":"But when He tries him and restricts his provision, he says, \"My Lord has humiliated me.\"","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"89:17","t":"No! But you do not honor the orphan","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"89:18","t":"And you do not encourage one another to feed the poor.","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"89:19","t":"And you consume inheritance, devouring [it] altogether,","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"89:20","t":"And you love wealth with immense love.","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"89:21","t":"No! When the earth has been leveled - pounded and crushed","j":30,"h":6